function a(n){return n?String(n).substring(11,16):"—"}function o(n){return n?String(n).substring(0,10):"—"}function f(n){return n?String(n).substring(0,19).replace("T"," "):"—"}function g(n){return!n||n.length<10?n||"":n.substring(0,3)+"********"+n.substring(n.length-4)}function c(n,i){const s=new Date(String(n).replace(" ","T")),u=new Date(String(i).replace(" ","T")),t=Math.round((u-s)/6e4);if(t<60)return`${t}分`;const r=Math.floor(t/60),e=t%60;return e?`${r}时${e}分`:`${r}时`}export{a,f as b,c,o as f,g as m};
